    "intro": {
      "zh": "Microsoft Xbox 是微软 2001 年发布的第六代家用游戏机，是微软进军游戏主机市场的首台作品，内置硬盘与以太网接口，以 PC 架构与在线服务切入市场，与 PS2、GameCube 形成三足鼎立。它是游戏机厅第六代主机「微软入局」叙事线的核心锚点。",
      "en": "The Microsoft Xbox, released in 2001, was a sixth-generation home console and Microsoft's first entry into the console market, featuring a built-in hard drive and Ethernet port, using PC architecture and online services to compete against the PS2 and GameCube."
    },
    "era": 2001,
    "manufacturer": "Microsoft"
  },
